# Upstream extension, cloned for line-by-line porting. Not vendored.
#
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, this rule also swallowed
# `app/src/test/.../replay/reference/`, which is where the Phase 0/1 parity
# implementation lives — a parity gate whose implementation and tests are invisible
# to `git status` and absent from a clean clone proves nothing about the versioned
# change set. See `<redacted-private-path>` P0.
/reference/

